      "tip": {
        "de": "Hilf dem Hoartoise und besiege die Feinde",
        "en": "Assist the Hoartoise and defeat the enemies",
        "es": "Asiste a la Escartuga y derrota a los enemigos.",
        "fr": "Aider le Torturoid et vaincre les ennemis",
        "ja": "亀に協力して敵を倒す",
        "ko": "서릿땅거북을 도와 적 격파하기",
        "th": "ช่วยเต่าน้ำค้างแข็งและพิชิตศัตรู",
        "zh-Hans": "协助龟龟击败敌人",
